DART / chucking-eggs includes adapted rule-based Guan Dan bots for research
benchmarking.

Vendored competition submissions live under:

- `ml/src/guandan/agents/_vendor/ez/`
- `ml/src/guandan/agents/_vendor/hulalala/`
- `ml/src/guandan/agents/_vendor/jidan/`
- `ml/src/guandan/agents/_vendor/lalala/`
- `ml/src/guandan/agents/_vendor/liuzha/`
- `ml/src/guandan/agents/_vendor/noai/`
- `ml/src/guandan/agents/_vendor/wjsd/`
- `ml/src/guandan/agents/_vendor/yaoji/`

These bots originate from the NJUPT 2020 Guan Dan AI Competition submissions
and preserve original author/team attribution in their package files where it
was available. The original submissions did not include explicit open-source
license files in this repository snapshot. They are included in good faith as
attributed research artifacts for evaluation reproducibility.

If you are an original author or rights holder and want a different attribution,
license note, or removal, please open an issue or contact the maintainer.
